  "scope": "Wire-encoding and message-framing vector conformance for BOLT 1 BigSize/TLV and the BOLT 8 transport frame, plus pinned rust-lightning differential fixtures. The BOLT 8 transport model is promoted to LnLean.Wire.Transport in LnLean/Wire/Message.lean; the payload-only Wire.unframe is unchanged. This is NOT a full implementation test: it checks encoded bytes and the modelled accept/reject decisions for a finite vector set. IO, allocation limits, message-specific TLV value decoding, namespace/known-type policy, Noise encryption, and byte-for-byte equivalence with a running rust-lightning node are out of scope.",
